        "Fast Koopman Surrogate Falsification Using Linear Relaxations and Weights."
        <em>International Symposium on Automated Technology for Verification and Analysis (ATVA)</em>, 2024.
        <a href="https://hal.science/hal-04962665v1/file/FastKoopman-ATVA24.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="pub-link">(pdf)</a>
      </li>
      <li>
        Ali Arjomandbigdeli, <strong class="me">Andrew Mata</strong>, and Stanley Bak.
        "Verification of Neural Network Control Systems in Continuous Time."
        <em>7th Symposium on AI Verification (SAIV)</em>, 2024.
        <a href="https://arxiv.org/pdf/2406.00157" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="pub-link">(pdf)</a>
      </li>
    </ol>

    <h3 class="pub-category">Other</h3>
    <ol class="pub-list" start="6">
      <li>
        <strong class="me">Andrew Mata</strong>, Ali Arjomandbigdeli, and Stanley Bak.
        "Symbolic Gaussian Smoothing."
        <em>ACM/IEEE 16th International Conference on Cyber-Physical Systems (ICCPS)</em>, 2025.
        <a href="https://dl.acm.org/doi/pdf/10.1145/3716550.3725169" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="pub-link">(pdf)</a>
      </li>
    </ol>
  </section>

  <section class="section" id="experience">
    <h2>Experience</h2>

    <div class="exp-entry">
      <div class="exp-header">
        <h3>Graduate Research Assistant</h3>
        <span class="exp-date">2021 — Present</span>
      </div>
      <p class="exp-org">Stony Brook University, Reliable Systems Lab — advised by Prof. Stanley Bak</p>
    </div>

    <div class="exp-entry">
      <div class="exp-header">
        <h3>Research Intern</h3>
        <span class="exp-date">Summer 2024</span>
      </div>
      <p class="exp-org">Air Force Research Laboratory (AFRL), Autonomy Capability Team (ACT3)</p>
      <p class="exp-desc">Designed adversarial stress-tests for RL-based autonomous controllers. Implemented Python attack workflows integrating Zero-One Attack with ACT3's training infrastructure.</p>
